{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄭秀文（Sammi）今天（22日）戴上總值約500萬元珠寶首飾行頭亮相活動，她回憶當年推出人生首張唱片獲分紅，即買鑽石戒指獎勵自己。</p><p>「隻戒指仔值4萬多元，當年買完好開心，一直保存至今，不過平日好少戴，好似已送了給家姐。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:01.983542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:18:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:58:12.712904+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:30.980878+00:00","content_hash":"9d1900a070537cd3628c390c2b95e59cd372b631d6a75d4cc7d90703d352da08","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}